tuxoflood (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: penguin themed colour-flood puzzle (Flood-It style)
    with 23 levels growing from 6x6 / 3 colours to 26x26 / 16 colours
    plus endless mode, a move limit computed from a built-in solver,
    stars and scoring, colour-blind symbols, Hungarian and English user
    interface, statistics, sound effects and music.

